          "description": "Shell conical, turbiniform consisting of c. 3 whorls (apex and early teleoconch whorls missing); whorl face nearly straight to slightly convex; periphery low on whorl just above suture; whorls ornamented by several collabral ribs which are separated in three rows of coarse nodes by two spiral grooves; suture shallow; base rounded and convex without ornament; seemingly minutely phaneromphalous; aperture sub-oval.",
          "sourcedFrom": "gbif",
          "wikipediaTitle": "gbif:4958503",
